    "regime_notes": "Daily IC was positive in 2020-2022 (+0.01968), 2023-2024 (+0.02555), and 2025-2027 (+0.01471), with some weakening in the latest regime. Cross-section uses 15 tradable benchmark instruments and at least 8 valid instruments per date."
  },
